dwarf cleric Karla Lightaxe female~
the dwarven cleric, Karla Lightaxe~
A stout female dwarf, armored and robed as a high priestess, nods at you.
~
Right away, as soon as you see her armor, the heavy battle-hammer resting on
her shoulder, and the long beard, braided with white silk and gold ribbons,
you know who this cleric is.  Karla Lightaxe is the subject of many tales, all
of them glorious.  She wields great power in battle, both her own and her
gods.
~
